+*  Memory usage formula : N->2^N Bytes (examples : 10 -> 1KB; 12 -> 4KB ; 16 -> 64KB; 20 -> 1MB; etc.)
+*  Increasing memory usage improves compression ratio
+*  Reduced memory usage can improve speed, due to cache effect */
