+HUFv05_decompress():
+    Decompress Huff0 data from buffer 'cSrc', of size 'cSrcSize',
+    into already allocated destination buffer 'dst', of size 'dstSize'.
+    @dstSize : must be the **exact** size of original (uncompressed) data.
